": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=en1Gj-M5lAYQ7kNvwGhDi54&_nc_oc=AdpS6-1Qfb4UyZU3I1xvvZW1k3vGweB-FknhfMoh2eAFCdgxxTR_Ev_x4eErAlk6ux0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLrqZDTTks_pjpZsQSl1h9owf3y1Mz_TW7DoAfMiSUk0g&oe=6AAC101B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMQ36-TY_mkQ7kNvwFczNJL&_nc_oc=Ado9dF5_-KZK3wUTeOn4KUaiGIORWr8fmVFqCu4fad3FZP94ddGSHzCykyuoO-dEJRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKlVkYA_odMNdfHSfPda4WdMh3Q_jdu1T9bZKHz_M3bcA&oe=6AAC0061"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AiEgZ_FbsJ0Q7kNvwFbI74M&_nc_oc=AdpuPPWf-VELY2C0gC6L-7XkcmXV5auhSAdOEAXKJrZUXQTQOZvPwPCPBXwe8PY_cto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIFE8Z8yWDdi_AySbfb-zbia2VmbqLiIMToUVDbBASzsg&oe=6AABED2F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rw0uxTNrf98Q7kNvwHPrIvQ&_nc_oc=Adq29MRvCR3I1wrjic6b2vzge35o-uYjZlEDSB4E0Rb84LXGdekFirnubtUnXPblKk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJT4skefzwpPbedBiuoKC46HHSXbZMuW78y3grzAjcoKg&oe=6AABECD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SUwVGjMUi1gQ7kNvwGWiN8Y&_nc_oc=AdrwFpnS0xNjs2dKOhvmaefgn3vDr-HlkTsVNtsA7MdKzO2Ey0KCEvvQNJoqmy0VQ4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ80LN4h327A2EG4jynHLHxYFnV-4besBnWhAo5cTnAVg&oe=6AABF67D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a